      <activity id="dc6d6fe0-dca7-5d26-a304-5ef3b4b055f9" activityNameId="8c03a55e-73e9-542b-b6c3-b50d2a07cb12" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Docking station, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Docking station, at plant
The dataset represents the typical docking station productions; UUID: 7968fc52-e18a-375f-8642-61dbe3acd126
The dataset is developed using modeling parameters from the LCA study of Dell docking stations family. The total mass of the docking station is 0.6 kg. The docking comprises a power supply unit 180W, power adapter, aluminum and plastics casing, plugs, ports and cables. The bill of materials are taken from the manufacturers' datasheets.
Location: Data for global average docking stations.
Technology: Standard docking station for laptops.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7968fc52-e18a-375f-8642-61dbe3acd126.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
